## Interface: 11508, 11509
## Title: WoW Forever Sync
## Notes: Exports your character, gear, bags and bank for the WoW Forever gear and DPS tool.
## Author: WoW Forever Tools
## Version: 1.0.0
## SavedVariables: WoWForeverSyncDB

# Interface is Classic Era 1.15.8 and 1.15.9, which is the API surface Forever
# is built on. The number is major * 10000 + minor * 100 + patch.
#
# When the Forever client ships, get its real number in game with
#   /run print(select(4, GetBuildInfo()))
# and add it to the list. Listing several is fine and is how every addon covers
# more than one client.
#
# Releasing to CurseForge also wants a project id here, once the project exists:
#   ## X-Curse-Project-ID: 000000
# See addon/RELEASING.md in the repository.

json.lua
scan.lua
export.lua
ui.lua
